WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:02.303
- How would you guys like
to have a bath with me?

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:06.747
- That's very intimate
on our first interview.

00:00:06.747 --> 00:00:09.830
(instrumental music)

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:15.640
And we are here in the heart
of beautiful Istanbul, Turkey

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.683
to experience a traditional
Turkish bath, or a hamam.

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:21.160
And while sometimes it's nice
to do things on your own,

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.710
it's even better when you
get to share the experience.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:26.530
So I've decided to find
myself a strange man here

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:28.573
to have a bath with.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:32.283
Since hamams are typically
separated by gender,

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.610
I am left with only being able

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:37.263
to ask men to join me at my bath.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.300
We will find a man for me to bathe with.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:40.133
We still have time.

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:41.050
Where are you from?

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:47.460
Well, I had a question
mainly for your father.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:50.830
I'm experiencing my first
Turkish bath very shortly.

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:52.140
It's a cultural experience.

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:54.683
I was wondering if you would
like to take a bath with me?

00:00:54.785 --> 00:00:57.035
(laughing)

00:01:04.514 --> 00:01:05.931
- [Aria] Come on.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:10.733
- There's no happy ending at this hamam.

00:01:17.549 --> 00:01:18.382
- Where are we going?

00:01:18.382 --> 00:01:20.860
- [Aria] It's literally around
the corner down the street.

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:21.693
- Okay.

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:24.010
- If you can do it too,
we'll get you in there too.

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:24.900
- All right, cool.

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:27.760
- With Shahz and Abdi
both agreeing to join me

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:29.860
on this adventure, we make our way

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:34.513
to the incredible
300-year-old Cagaloglu Hamam.

00:01:34.550 --> 00:01:36.830
This is the type of thing that
hopefully decades from now

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:38.230
or possibly in a month or so

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:40.320
at one of your funerals,
we could talk about this.

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:42.540
- Well, I hope not in the
words, that, but yeah.

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:43.373
- You never know.

00:01:43.373 --> 00:01:45.493
Death comes when you least expect it.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:47.260
Let's get on in here before they back out.

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:50.533
Let's go. (laughing)
(instrumental music)

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:56.853
We are one of the oldest hamam.

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:03.660
- In the old times, people
don't have any much places

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:05.610
and go somewhere and spend their time.

00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:08.533
A lot of people come
here, places like that,

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:10.853
and they spent their time inside.

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:14.220
And then they left as
a kind of a new person.

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:16.593
It's one of the biggest
part of our culture,

00:02:16.930 --> 00:02:18.530
and we are trying to protect it.

00:02:22.476 --> 00:02:23.793
- [Aria] Thank you so much.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.993
And after we get appropriately dressed,

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:32.133
we're ready to start our treatment.

00:02:32.695 --> 00:02:33.528
Oh!

00:02:33.528 --> 00:02:36.700
- [Mustafa] Your treatment is
going to be in three parts,

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:38.313
first, the hot room rest.

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:42.500
- [Mustafa] It's like a sauna.

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:45.360
You're gonna get sweats
like 15 or 10 minutes,

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:46.410
it depends on your skin,

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:48.750
to get your body ready to treatments.

00:02:57.640 --> 00:03:00.563
- [Mustafa] After that, our
therapist will wash your body.

00:03:00.788 --> 00:03:01.970
- Oh, it's hot!

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:04.803
- [Mustafa] To clean you from your sweats.

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:07.170
And then he is gonna make a scrub

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:08.850
like 10 minutes on your body.

00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:10.783
It's like a peeling for your skin.

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:26.663
Oh, hot!

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:28.970
- [Mustafa] And then
he will wash you again,

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:31.230
and while you're laying
down on the hot marble,

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:33.230
he will cover your body with the bubble.

00:03:35.177 --> 00:03:37.663
[Mustafa] To get your
skin more soft again.

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:48.690
- [Mustafa] And then he is
gonna make a massage on you.

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:49.940
- Oh, oh, oh, (bleeping).

00:03:53.684 --> 00:03:54.910
- [Mustafa] We call it foam massage,

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:56.450
or you can call it bubble massage.

00:03:56.450 --> 00:03:57.400
It's the same name.

00:03:59.517 --> 00:04:00.453
- Ooh, ow!

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:07.370
- [Mustafa] And then
he will wash you again.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:11.010
And then your treatment
is going to be over.

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:14.143
It's traditional, classical
Turkish hamam material.

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:19.473
Although now veering
slightly off tradition,

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:22.460
I've been invited to take
what I've learned from Erol.

00:04:25.852 --> 00:04:26.685
Oh!

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:28.973
- [Aria] And apply it to my new friends.

00:05:05.238 --> 00:05:06.071
- No, no, no, no.

00:05:19.439 --> 00:05:21.590
- [Aria] One of my favorite
things about traveling

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:24.053
is the people you can meet along the way.

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:27.180
And while I'm sure I would
have still had an amazing time

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:30.550
on my own, I'm glad I got
to share this experience

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:33.823
with a couple of guys who had
just as great a time as I did.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:36.973
And as Shahz put it best
earlier in the evening.

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:02.303
- To travel and to friendship.

00:06:02.810 --> 00:06:03.643
- Cheers.

00:06:08.994 --> 00:06:12.077
(instrumental music)

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:15.410
- Hey, Unsolved is on a new channel,

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:16.243
and now your part.

00:06:16.243 --> 00:06:17.120
- [Both] Subscribe here.

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:18.233
- That was my part.

